In the iframe, the game runs with its own window listeners — events dispatched on the iframe's document/window bubble to its window ✓ (window receives document events ✓). pointermove listeners on window of iframe — dispatch pointermove on iframe doc.body (or any element) with bubbles → reaches window ✓.

